# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repo publishes CODE + METHOD only.
#
# Nothing that is content ships here: no prompts, no captions, no tag strings,
# no artist names, no post ids, no pixels, no generated samples, no logs, and
# nothing adult-rated. Files listed below stay on the training machine only —
# several are still required at run time, they are just never committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- prompt sets and prompt text (eval inputs; still used by the run) --------
# Every JSON directly under eval/ is a prompt set, so the rule is the directory, not a
# name pattern: an ad-hoc set added later is excluded by default rather than by memory.
# (Generated JSON such as convergence reports lives under eval/outputs/, ignored below.)
eval/*.json
eval/*.md
!eval/EVAL_DESIGN.md

# --- caption materials + anything that quotes captions or tag literals -------
# The profile implementation, its config and the verifier are withheld too: they
# embed the content-rating taxonomy and tag-family literals as functional
# constants. They hold no captions, ids or dataset rows — the method itself is
# documented in caption/PROFILE.md. All three are still required at run time.
caption/preview_materials.sqlite
caption/*.sqlite
caption/*.db
caption/verify_report.txt
caption/verify_preview_caption_synth.py
caption/krea2_caption_synth.snapshot.py
caption/caption_synth_preview_config.json
caption/TASK1_SUMMARY.md

# --- training data and latent cache (private dataset pixels / derivatives) ---
train/dataset/
train/cache/

# --- checkpoints and optimizer states (25.8 GB each) ------------------------
train/ckpt/
*.safetensors
*.pt
*.bin

# --- run logs (per-step captions, post ids, local paths) --------------------
logs/

# --- generated eval images, thumbnails, review pages -----------------------
eval/outputs/

# --- cross-session handover notes (NEVER commit) ----------------------------
# Local absolute paths, dataset internals and unpublished judgements. Listed
# ahead of any broader rule so nothing can re-include it.
memory.md
/memory.md

# --- python ----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
